{
    "background_story": "Handsome was a majestic Selkirk Rex cat, known for his stunning curly coat and endearing personality. Born on a Scottish farm, he was named after the rugged Selkirk Mountains that towered above the rolling hills. Handsome spent his days lounging in the sun-drenched barn, chasing the occasional mouse, and purring contentedly as the farmer's children petted him. But despite his idyllic life, Handsome had a taste for adventure. He would often slip out of the barn at night, exploring the surrounding countryside and returning with tales of his escapades in the form of twigs and leaves stuck to his fur. The farmer's family adored Handsome's curious spirit and affectionate nature, and he remained the beloved king of the farm until his golden years.",
